<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Supermodels</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">South Arcade</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Supermodels</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2JFmXR9RMrZ864QAaZp1qy</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.160" end="00:15.160">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.242" end="00:26.200">We're gettin' everybody mad when we pull up on the scene</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.200" end="00:30.024">I didn't mean to crash your party, what's your problem with me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.024" end="00:33.961">And we got like one shot left, sat in this blacked out car</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.961" end="00:37.824">But we roll the windows down, because they all know who we are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.824" end="00:39.583">Well, what we doing? (We don't know)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.583" end="00:41.405">What can it be? (What can it be?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.405" end="00:43.232">So where we going? (To the show)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.232" end="00:45.157">You want a piece of me? (You want a piece of me?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.157" end="00:49.159">And we got like one shot left, we gotta get this right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.159" end="00:52.892">'Cause you know you're only in it for life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.892" end="00:56.589">But your girlfriend's only into supermodels</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.589" end="01:00.393">Except the hottest thing I can see poppin' bottles</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.393" end="01:04.292">And it's like movie stars, they find me kinda trouble</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.292" end="01:08.278">And I got both hands on the wheel but I kinda like it how</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.278" end="01:11.909">They try to block us out, but I'm on your radio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.909" end="01:15.865">They tried to keep us in the carriage, but we're running this show</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.865" end="01:17.828">And now I'm lookin' in the mirror like, "Who wouldn't wanna be me?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.828" end="01:19.652">Like how did we get here? When did somebody win a freebie?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.652" end="01:23.515">No friends in high places, got a lucky hand and it's all aces</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.515" end="01:27.165">Bet your girlfriend's only into supermodels</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.165" end="01:30.965">Except the hottest thing I can see poppin' bottles</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.965" end="01:34.841">And it's like movie stars, they find me kinda trouble</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.841" end="01:39.327">And I got both hands on the wheel, but I kinda like it when you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.327" end="01:42.016">Dance like there's nobody near ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.016" end="01:45.863">I like it how it sounds though we're not in your speaker</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.863" end="01:49.614">I like it when it's loud, keep it red in the meter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.614" end="01:52.309">I like it when the whole crowd sings</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.309" end="02:00.309">I can't hear ya, can't hear ya, can't hear ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.157" end="02:14.157">Three, two, one, go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.306" end="02:27.903">I like it when you dance like there's nobody near you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.903" end="02:31.725">I like it how it sounds though we're not in your speaker</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.725" end="02:35.618">I like it when it's loud, keep it red in the meter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.618" end="02:38.100">I like it when the whole crowd sings</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.100" end="02:40.888">I can't hear ya, can't hear ya, can't hear ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.888" end="02:45.900">Can't hear ya, can't hear ya (three, two, one)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.900" end="02:49.565">Bet your girlfriend's only into supermodels</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.565" end="02:53.250">Except the hottest thing I can see poppin' bottles</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.250" end="02:57.260">And it's like movie stars, they find me kinda trouble</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.260" end="03:01.762">And I got both hands on the wheel, but I kinda like it when you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.762" end="03:04.288">Dance like there's nobody near ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.288" end="03:08.124">I like it how it sounds though we're not in your speaker</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.124" end="03:11.975">I like it when it's loud, keep it red in the meter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.975" end="03:14.475">I like it when the whole crowd sings</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.475" end="03:18.475">I can't hear ya, can't hear ya, can't hear ya</p></div></body></tt>